<programme start="20261031160000 +0000" stop="20261031190000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Arizona at Texas Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 22 Arizona Wildcats visit the No. 13 Texas Tech Red Raiders for a Big 12 game. The Arizona Wildcats beat the Iowa State Cyclones 39-3 led by Noah Fifita, while the Texas Tech Red Raiders suffered a 37-24 loss to the Cincinnati Bearcats.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
