<programme start="20261031194500 +0000" stop="20261031224500 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Utah at Cincinnati</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Cincinnati Bearcats (5-2) host the No. 6 Utah Utes (7-0) for a Big 12 matchup at Nippert Stadium. Utah seeks to extend its winning streak to eight games after a 21-13 victory over Houston. Cincinnati beat Texas Tech 37-24 behind JC French IV.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
