<programme start="20261031233000 +0000" stop="20261101023000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Mississippi State at Texas</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Mississippi State Bulldogs (4-3) take on the No. 11 Texas Longhorns (5-2) in an SEC game at DKR-Texas Memorial Stadium. Mississippi State fell 23-15 to Oklahoma and leans on Parker Puckett, while Texas defeated Ole Miss 34-27 behind Arch Manning.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
