<programme start="20261102140000 +0000" stop="20261102150000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">Melissa</title><sub-title lang="es">Amor en el aire</sub-title><desc lang="es">Azra le dice a Busra que al nacer su hijo, se lo entregará. Kadir trata de reconquistar a Yesim con poemas. Hazim lleva a cabo su plan, pero Melissa, sin querer, lo impide.</desc><credits><director>Çagil Aydogdu</director><actor>Beren Gökyıldız</actor><actor>Dila Uluca</actor><actor>Ümit Akdemir</actor><actor>Mahmoud Kasalkheh</actor><actor>Sezin Bozaci</actor><actor>Mert Aydogdu</actor><actor>Ali Senol</actor><actor>Onur Dikmen</actor></credits><date>20261030</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.137.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E138</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/626913d8e37db2fe609144a8dc5c2e0c.jpeg"/></programme>
